# The for-of steps a generator that itself steps another generator: other code runs while the loop's frame stands at no operation, so the try's list of operations that ran other code holds an empty name.
# A text grows in the loop, so the walk asks whether it grows in a quiet turn: of a place that nobody can name nothing is known: the text keeps its builder. (The question once asked the body's index for the opcode of the empty name: a trap in the compiler.)
# RUN: walk f3 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: isLoopHead=true
